<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/domain_expert> dcterms:title "Domain Expert" ;
	skos:altLabel "Domain Experts" ;
	linkml:description "Giving knowledge of the sector or setting where the system is used." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/double> a linkml:TypeDefinition ;
	skos:closeMatch "schema:Float"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:editorialNote "If you are authoring schemas in LinkML YAML, the type is referenced with the lower case \"double\"." ;
