<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/operate_and_monitor> dcterms:title "Operate and Monitor" ;
	linkml:description "Operating the system and continually assessing its recommendations and impacts." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/operation_and_monitoring> dcterms:title "Operation and Monitoring" ;
	linkml:description "Running the system and regularly assessing its output and impacts." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/organization> dcterms:title "Harm to an Organization" ;
	linkml:description "Harm that falls on an organization." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/organizational_integration_and_management_of_risk> dcterms:title "Organizational Integration and Management of Risk" ;
	linkml:description "AI risk belongs inside broader enterprise risk management, with accountability and commitment from senior levels." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/organizations> dcterms:title "Organizations" ;
	linkml:description "Organizations." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/other_ai_actors> dcterms:title "Other AI actors" ;
	linkml:description "Those who may provide norms or guidance on AI risk, such as standards bodies, advocacy groups and researchers." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/people> dcterms:title "Harm to People" ;
	linkml:description "Harm that falls on individuals, groups, communities or society." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/people_and_planet> dcterms:title "People and Planet" ;
	linkml:description "Human rights and the well-being of society and the planet, at the center of Figure 2." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/plan_and_design> dcterms:title "Plan and Design" ;
	linkml:description "Documenting the concept, objectives, assumptions, context and requirements." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/planet> dcterms:title "The planet" ;
	linkml:description "The planet as a whole." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/positive> dcterms:title "Positive" ;
	linkml:description "An opportunity or benefit." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/primary> dcterms:title "Primary audience" ;
	linkml:description "AI actors who carry out or manage work on AI systems and drive their risk management." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/privacy_enhanced> dcterms:title "Privacy-Enhanced" ;
	linkml:description "Guided by the norms and practices that protect human autonomy, identity and dignity, such as anonymity, confidentiality and control." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/procurement> dcterms:title "Procurement" ;
	linkml:description "Acquiring AI from another party, under financial, legal or policy authority." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/reputation> dcterms:title "Reputation" ;
	linkml:description "To an organization's standing." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/risk_at_different_lifecycle_stages> dcterms:title "Risk at different stages of the AI lifecycle" ;
	linkml:description "Results differ by stage, some risks stay latent, and AI actors see risk differently." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/risk_in_real_world_settings> dcterms:title "Risk in real-world settings" ;
	linkml:description "What a laboratory measures may differ from what emerges in operation." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/risk_measurement> dcterms:title "Risk Measurement" ;
	linkml:description "AI risks that are poorly defined or understood are hard to measure, which does not mean they are high or low." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/risk_prioritization> dcterms:title "Risk Prioritization" ;
	linkml:description "Eliminating all negative risk is unrealistic, so effort goes first to the highest risks in a context of use." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/risk_tolerance> dcterms:title "Risk Tolerance" ;
	linkml:description "The AI RMF can prioritize risk but prescribes no tolerance, which depends on context and changes over time." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/safe> dcterms:title "Safe" ;
	linkml:description "Keeps people, property and the environment out of danger under defined conditions." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/secure_and_resilient> dcterms:title "Secure and Resilient" ;
	linkml:description "Withstands adverse events and recovers from them, and keeps confidentiality, integrity and availability through protections against attack." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/security_breach_or_monetary_loss> dcterms:title "Security breaches or monetary loss" ;
	linkml:description "To an organization through a breach of security or a loss of money." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/societal> dcterms:title "Societal" ;
	linkml:description "To democratic participation or educational access." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/society> dcterms:title "Society" ;
	linkml:description "Society at large." .
