<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/systemic> dcterms:title "Systemic" ;
	linkml:description "In datasets, in organizational norms and processes, and in the wider society that uses AI." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/target> dcterms:title "Target Profile" ;
	linkml:description "A temporal profile saying which outcomes the desired risk management goals need." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/task_and_output> dcterms:title "Task and Output" ;
	linkml:description "What the system does and produces once deployed." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/tevv> dcterms:title "Test, Evaluation, Verification, and Validation (TEVV)" ;
	skos:altLabel "TEVV" ;
	linkml:description "Examining the system or its components and finding and fixing problems, throughout the lifecycle." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/third_party_entities> dcterms:title "Third-party entities" ;
	linkml:description "Outside organizations that supply or evaluate the data, models, systems or services an organization acquires." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/third_party_software_hardware_and_data> dcterms:title "Risks related to third-party software, hardware, and data" ;
	linkml:description "Third-party parts can speed work, but their metrics may not match or be disclosed, and how they are used adds risk." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-ai-100-1/time> a linkml:TypeDefinition ;
